OL,4,CMan charged with murder of missing 20- 
OL,5,Cyear-old woman                         
OL,6,GA man has appeared in court charged    
OL,7,Gwith the murder of a missing 20-year-  
OL,8,Gold woman in Dumfries and Galloway.    
OL,10,FKelsey Hunter was last seen in Castle  
OL,11,FDouglas at 17:00 on Saturday. A major  
OL,12,Fsearch is under way in the nearby      
OL,13,Fvillage of Springholm where she lives. 
OL,15,FDaniel McKnight, 21, has appeared on   
OL,16,Fpetition in Dumfries Sheriff Court     
OL,17,Fcharged with murder and two other      
OL,18,Fcharges, including defeating the ends  
OL,19,Fof justice.                            
OL,21,FHe made no plea and was remanded in    
OL,22,Fcustody.                               
